# Files excluded from the distributed plugin zip (wordpress.org).
#
# Note: `/vendor` is excluded while the plugin has no runtime Composer
# dependencies. Once runtime dependencies are added, ship a scoped build
# (PHP-Scoper/Mozart) of `vendor/` instead of excluding it.

